  "body": "When implementing this algorithm for Ladybird, I had to add null checks of the \"pending request\", whenever calling \"abort the image request\" for the \"pending request\".\r\n\r\nHere's how it looks in our implementation:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/SerenityOS/serenity/blob/0f1f95da46cfa787483342fd7b982da588ea8387/Userland/Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/HTMLImageElement.cpp#L324-L326\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/SerenityOS/serenity/blob/0f1f95da46cfa787483342fd7b982da588ea8387/Userland/Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/HTMLImageElement.cpp#L384-L386\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/SerenityOS/serenity/blob/0f1f95da46cfa787483342fd7b982da588ea8387/Userland/Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/HTMLImageElement.cpp#L411-L413\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/SerenityOS/serenity/blob/0f1f95da46cfa787483342fd7b982da588ea8387/Userland/Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/HTMLImageElement.cpp#L443-L445\r\n\r\nThe spec did tell us to null check \"pending request\" in one place, so we're covered here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/SerenityOS/serenity/blob/0f1f95da46cfa787483342fd7b982da588ea8387/Userland/Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/HTMLImageElement.cpp#L454-L456",
